at":"2018-04-20T14:52:28Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Running Psalm 1.1.0 against the following file fails to infer the type of the expression in `PsalmTest\\Example::get`.\r\n\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\ndeclare(strict_types = 1);\r\n\r\nnamespace PsalmTest;\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * @template T\r\n */\r\nfinal class Example\r\n{\r\n    /** @var T $x */\r\n    private $x;\r\n\r\n    /** @param T $x */\r\n    public function __construct($x)\r\n    {\r\n        $this->x = $x;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /** @return T */\r\n    public function get()\r\n    {\r\n        return $this->x;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe following error is printed.\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: MixedReturnStatement - src/PsalmTest/Example.php:23:9 - Could not infer a return type\r\n        return $this->x;\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe following is my Psalm configuration.\r\n\r\n```xml\r\n<?xml version=\"1.0\"?>\r\n<psalm\r\n    totallyTyped=\"true\"\r\n    xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\"\r\n    xsi:schemaLocation=\"/home/r/psalm-test/vendor/vimeo/psalm/src/config.xsd\"\r\n>\r\n    <projectFiles>\r\n        <directory name=\"src\" />\r\n    </projectFiles>\r\n</psalm>\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt seems like it should work. If I change the return statement to `return 42;` then it gives an error about returning an `int` where a `T` is expected, as expected.","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","sta